SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_Grunt1Intro::
    .string "Nothing to see up here.\p"
    .string "Just a chart of the sea floor and\n"
    .string "two men taking an interest in it.$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_Grunt1Defeat::
    .string "You battle like the sea's on your\n"
    .string "side…$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_Grunt1Post::
    .string "Read the chart all you like. We\n"
    .string "already know what's under it.$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_Grunt2Intro::
    .string "You're KANTO, aren't you. Came over\n"
    .string "the water with a BADGE case.\p"
    .string "The sea doesn't care about BADGES.$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_Grunt2Defeat::
    .string "Fine. Take the chart. It's copied\n"
    .string "already…$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_Grunt2Post::
    .string "TEAM AQUA doesn't steal. We take\n"
    .string "back what the sea is owed.$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_ArchieWarning::
    .string "That's enough. Both of you, out.\p"
    .string "ARCHIE. These two are mine, and\n"
    .string "the trouble they made is mine too.\p"
    .string "So you're the one KANTO sent its\n"
    .string "LEAGUE home to.\p"
    .string "I won't battle a guest on their\n"
    .string "first day. Look at the chart.\l"
    .string "Look at how much of it is blank.\p"
    .string "When you understand why that\n"
    .string "blank part matters, come and find\l"
    .string "me. We'll have words then.$"

SlateportCity_OceanicMuseum_2F_Text_MuseumQuiet::
    .string "The gallery is quiet again.\p"
    .string "STERN's survey hangs where it was,\n"
    .string "with the blank stretch of sea floor\l"
